'''Xeric's guard''' is a cosmetic cape that can be obtained from [[Captain Rimor]] by the entrance to the [[Chambers of Xeric]] after completing 100 Chambers of Xeric in [[Chambers of Xeric/Challenge Mode|Challenge Mode]].

{{Costume storage|cape rack}} It can also be mounted on a [[cape hanger]] in an [[Achievement Gallery]].

